{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.HookSumClosedForm","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HookSumClosedForm","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.PieceAGeneral"],"declarations":15,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.HookSum.sum_hookZ_eq_bStat","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HookSum.sum_hookZ_eq_bStat","kind":"theorem","line":238,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/HookSumClosedForm.lean#L238-L246","doc":"**The hook-sum identity in the `n(λ)` register**: `Σ_c h(c) = b(λ') + b(λ) + n`.\nThis is `QOU.Common.HookSumComplete.hookSum_eq` on `YoungDiagram` over `ℤ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.HookSum.sum_snd_eq_bStat_conj","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HookSum.sum_snd_eq_bStat_conj","kind":"theorem","line":227,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/HookSumClosedForm.lean#L227-L236","doc":"`Σ_c j(c) = Σ_j j·λ'_j = b(λ')`, the transpose of `sum_fst_eq_bStat`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.HookSum.sum_fst_eq_bStat","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HookSum.sum_fst_eq_bStat","kind":"theorem","line":217,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/HookSumClosedForm.lean#L217-L225","doc":"`Σ_c i(c) = Σ_i i·λ_i = b(λ)`: row `i` contributes `λ_i` cells, each of\nfirst coordinate `i`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.HookSum.two_mul_sum_hookZ_eq_sum_sq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HookSum.two_mul_sum_hookZ_eq_sum_sq","kind":"theorem","line":188,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/HookSumClosedForm.lean#L188-L209","doc":"**`Σ_h` is half the sum of `p₂` on `λ` and on `λ'`.** `2 Σ_c hook(c) =\nΣ_i λ_i² + Σ_j λ'_j²` — the conjugation-symmetric form. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.HookSum.two_mul_sum_hookZ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HookSum.two_mul_sum_hookZ","kind":"theorem","line":175,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/HookSumClosedForm.lean#L175-L186","doc":"**The hook-sum closed form.** `2 Σ_c hook(c) = Σ_i λ_i(λ_i−1) + Σ_j\nλ'_j(λ'_j−1) + 2n`, i.e. `Σ_c hook(c) = Σ_i C(λ_i,2) + Σ_j C(λ'_j,2) + n`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.HookSum.sum_hookZ_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HookSum.sum_hookZ_eq","kind":"theorem","line":161,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/HookSumClosedForm.lean#L161-L173","doc":"The hook sum splits into the two coordinate sums plus the cell count — the\narm and leg reflections of `PieceAGeneral` applied at `F = id`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.HookSum.two_mul_sum_fst","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HookSum.two_mul_sum_fst","kind":"theorem","line":147,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/HookSumClosedForm.lean#L147-L157","doc":"`2 · Σ_c i(c) = Σ_j λ'_j(λ'_j−1)`, the transpose of `two_mul_sum_snd`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.HookSum.two_mul_sum_snd","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HookSum.two_mul_sum_snd","kind":"theorem","line":137,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/HookSumClosedForm.lean#L137-L145","doc":"`2 · Σ_c j(c) = Σ_i λ_i(λ_i−1)`: summing the column index over the cells\ncounts, twice, the ordered same-row pairs. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.HookSum.sum_colLen_eq_card","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HookSum.sum_colLen_eq_card","kind":"theorem","line":126,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/HookSumClosedForm.lean#L126-L133","doc":"The column lengths sum to the number of cells. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.HookSum.card_transpose","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HookSum.card_transpose","kind":"theorem","line":119,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/HookSumClosedForm.lean#L119-L124","doc":"Transposing preserves the number of cells. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.HookSum.sum_rowLen_eq_card","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HookSum.sum_rowLen_eq_card","kind":"theorem","line":112,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/HookSumClosedForm.lean#L112-L117","doc":"The row lengths sum to the number of cells. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.HookSum.sum_cells_eq_sum_rows","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HookSum.sum_cells_eq_sum_rows","kind":"theorem","line":97,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/HookSumClosedForm.lean#L97-L110","doc":"**Cells-to-rows decomposition.** A sum over the cells of `μ` is the sum over\nrows `i < N` of the sum along row `i`, for any `N` covering the diagram. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.HookSum.fst_lt_colLen_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HookSum.fst_lt_colLen_zero","kind":"theorem","line":87,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/HookSumClosedForm.lean#L87-L95","doc":"Every cell sits in one of the first `μ.colLen 0` rows. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.HookSum.filter_fst_eq_row","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HookSum.filter_fst_eq_row","kind":"theorem","line":81,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/HookSumClosedForm.lean#L81-L85","doc":"The `i`-th row is exactly the cells whose first coordinate is `i`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.HookSum.two_mul_sum_range_cast","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HookSum.two_mul_sum_range_cast","kind":"theorem","line":68,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/HookSumClosedForm.lean#L68-L77","doc":"Gauss, cast to `ℤ`: `2 · Σ_{j<m} j = m(m−1)`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}